close_reason: Merge-fence evidence is bounded to the active Git worktree; an enclosing repository's fence never satisfies strict health
contract_change:
  api: "auditMergeAttributeFence (@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk, @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/merge)"
  before: "The fence audit walked up to eight logical parents of the tracker root and accepted the first .gitattributes with a managed block, even one above the Git worktree top level or reached through a symlink, which Git never applies"
  after: "Inside a Git worktree the audit walks the tracker's canonical path up to the worktree's canonical top level (resolved from the tracker root, or passed as options.gitWorkspaceRoot) and reads only regular attribute files, so pm health, pm validate and the workspace position read report a linked worktree without its own fence as merge_fence_missing"
  migrate: "No change for a fence at the worktree root or inside the same repository. To keep the old eight-level walk, pass { gitWorkspaceRoot: null }; a strict health check that newly fails needs pm merge install in that worktree, or a regular file in place of a symlinked .gitattributes"
escape_class: production_defect
