  gate_id: test-coverage
  negative_control: "With the worktree boundary check in auditMergeAttributeFence disabled, both tests in tests/unit/sdk/merge/fence-worktree-boundary.spec.ts fail at the not_installed expectation because the enclosing repository fence is accepted as ok"
